cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "Source-grounded hybrid extraction of construction procurement documents: evaluation harness, labels and reference implementation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, evaluation harness, hand-verified labels and analysis
  scripts for a source-grounded hybrid workflow that extracts decision-critical
  information from Spanish public works tender specifications. Every surfaced value
  must be locatable in the source text and monetary arithmetic is validated.
